<body marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" rightmargin="0" leftmargin=0 topmargin=0 bgcolor="#E3CBED" text="Black" link="Blue" vlink="Blue" alink="Yellow" background="img/bkg.jpg" bgproperties="FIXED">
	



 <TABLE width=95% align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" bordercolor="#333333" cellSpacing=0>
  <TR style="HEIGHT: 12.75pt" height=17> 
    <TD class=xl24 style="HEIGHT: 12.75pt" align=left height=17 nowrap colspan="6"> 
      <p align="center">NOTE: This chart assumes 'normal' dispelling and debuffing, 
        relative to a level 60 wizard</p>
      <p><b>Legend</b></p>
      <p>1 = Regular nukes hit most of the time.<br>
        2 = Regular nukes are somewhat resisted.<br>
        3 = About the same efficiency using regular nukes or lures.<br>
        4 = Lures are rarely (if ever) resisted.<br>
        5 = Lures are somewhat to often resisted.<br>
        6 = Lures are resisted so much I might as well play /gems.</p>
    </TD>
  </TR>
